1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo inahusu nani? Ni kuhusu mtu wa kihistoria.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Mchezo wa Samurai na Miyamoto Musashi

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:16,308
Jana usiku nilicheza mchezo mpya.

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,787
Mchezo wa aina gani?

5
00:00:18,811 --> 00:00:22,945
Mchezo wa samurai wa Japani.

6
00:00:22,968 --> 00:00:25,901
Ulikuwa mzuri sana.

7
00:00:25,924 --> 00:00:27,964
Nzuri sana!

8
00:00:27,988 --> 00:00:30,721
Ni nani anayeonekana?

9
00:00:30,744 --> 00:00:34,480
Anayeonekana ni mtu aitwa Miyamoto Musashi.

10
00:00:34,504 --> 00:00:38,537
Aa, Miyamoto Musashi?

11
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:41,527
Mtu mashuhuri sana.

12
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:43,240
Ndiyo.

13
00:00:43,264 --> 00:00:46,997
Lakini sijui sana kuhusu yeye.

14
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,273
Yeye ni mtu wa aina gani?

15
00:00:49,297 --> 00:00:55,464
Miyamoto Musashi alikuwa mpiganaji mkali wa upanga wa zamani wa Japani.

16
00:00:55,488 --> 00:00:57,421
Mpiganaji wa upanga?

17
00:00:57,444 --> 00:01:00,611
Alikuwa mkali kiasi gani?

18
00:01:00,634 --> 00:01:04,003
Alipigana zaidi ya mara sitini.

19
00:01:04,026 --> 00:01:07,714
Na hakupoteza hata mara moja.

20
00:01:07,738 --> 00:01:12,515
Haya, hakupoteza hata mara moja?

21
00:01:12,538 --> 00:01:15,033
Inauma sana!

22
00:01:15,057 --> 00:01:16,900
Ndiyo.

23
00:01:16,923 --> 00:01:21,057
Anasemekana alikuwa mwenye nguvu zaidi nchini Japani.

24
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:25,972
Katika mchezo, alikuwa na upanga mbili.

25
00:01:25,995 --> 00:01:27,886
Ndiyo.

26
00:01:27,910 --> 00:01:32,310
Musashi alipigana akiwa na upanga mbili.

27
00:01:32,333 --> 00:01:34,700
Kwa kawaida ni moja tu?

28
00:01:34,723 --> 00:01:36,656
Ndiyo.

29
00:01:36,679 --> 00:01:41,412
Kwa kawaida ni moja, lakini Musashi alitumia mbili.

30
00:01:41,435 --> 00:01:44,371
Hiyo ni nadra sana.

31
00:01:44,395 --> 00:01:47,428
Staili yake ni ya kuvutia.

32
00:01:47,451 --> 00:01:49,318
Ndiyo.

33
00:01:49,341 --> 00:01:53,994
Kwa hiyo, bado anapendwa katika filamu na anime hata leo.

34
00:01:54,018 --> 00:01:58,957
Musashi alikuwa mtu wa kupigana tu?

35
00:01:58,981 --> 00:02:02,989
Hapana, pia alikuwa mzuri katika kuchora picha.

36
00:02:03,012 --> 00:02:05,462
Aliandika vitabu pia.

37
00:02:05,486 --> 00:02:08,931
Haya, aliandika vitabu pia?

38
00:02:08,955 --> 00:02:11,288
Vitabu vya aina gani?

39
00:02:11,311 --> 00:02:14,544
Kitabu kinaitwa 'Go Rin No Sho'.

40
00:02:14,567 --> 00:02:17,251
Ni kitabu cha namna ya kupigana.

41
00:02:17,275 --> 00:02:21,512
Je, kitabu hicho kinaweza kusomwa leo?

42
00:02:21,535 --> 00:02:23,268
Ndiyo.

43
00:02:23,291 --> 00:02:26,170
Kinasomwa duniani kote.

44
00:02:26,194 --> 00:02:29,162
Ni maarufu hata nje ya nchi!

45
00:02:29,185 --> 00:02:31,038
Ndiyo.

46
00:02:31,061 --> 00:02:33,795
Watu wa biashara husoma sana.

47
00:02:33,817 --> 00:02:38,417
Watu wa biashara husoma kitabu cha kupigana?

48
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:40,882
Ni ya kuvutia!

49
00:02:40,906 --> 00:02:44,514
Kwa sababu njia ya kufikiria inasaidia.

50
00:02:44,537 --> 00:02:48,419
Nimechoshwa kusoma kitabu hicho.

51
00:02:48,443 --> 00:02:53,276
Mara ijayo nitakupatia kitabu rahisi cha Kijapani.

52
00:02:53,299 --> 00:02:55,066
Asante.

53
00:02:55,089 --> 00:02:58,222
Nitapiga mbio zaidi katika mchezo.

54
00:02:58,245 --> 00:03:07,254
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka maelezo na maoni ya juu.

55
00:03:07,254 --> 00:03:08,754
Mchezo wa 2: Oda Nobunaga na Ngome ya Azuchi

56
00:03:08,754 --> 00:03:13,165
Picha hii ya ngome iko wapi?

57
00:03:13,188 --> 00:03:16,846
Hiyo ni picha ya Ngome ya Azuchi.

58
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:20,241
Ni ngome ya Oda Nobunaga.

59
00:03:20,265 --> 00:03:23,065
Oda Nobunaga?

60
00:03:23,088 --> 00:03:26,654
Nimewahi kusikia jina lake.

61
00:03:26,677 --> 00:03:31,415
Yeye ni mmoja wa wapiganaji maarufu zaidi nchini Japani.

62
00:03:31,439 --> 00:03:35,640
Nobunaga alikuaje?

63
00:03:35,664 --> 00:03:41,130
Alikuwa mtu hodari sana na mpenzi wa vitu vipya.

64
00:03:41,153 --> 00:03:44,356
Vitu vipya?

65
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:47,277
Kama vitu gani kwa mfano?

66
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:51,867
Alipenda mkate na divai za kigeni.

67
00:03:51,890 --> 00:03:58,423
Eeh, mwanamapigani wa zamani akila mkate na divai?

68
00:03:58,446 --> 00:04:00,141
Ndiyo.

69
00:04:00,164 --> 00:04:05,931
Alivaa nguo za kigeni na hata kuvaa kofia.

70
00:04:05,954 --> 00:04:08,621
Inauma sana!

71
00:04:08,644 --> 00:04:11,930
Ni mtindo sana!

72
00:04:11,954 --> 00:04:13,638
Ndiyo, kweli.

73
00:04:13,661 --> 00:04:17,097
Alikuwa na saa na tufe ya dunia pia.

74
00:04:17,121 --> 00:04:20,488
Hata tufe ya dunia alikuwa nayo?

75
00:04:20,511 --> 00:04:22,844
Nimeghadhibika!

76
00:04:22,867 --> 00:04:27,565
Alikuwa na hamu kubwa sana kwa utamaduni wa kigeni.

77
00:04:27,589 --> 00:04:30,589
Je, alitumia bunduki?

78
00:04:30,612 --> 00:04:32,278
Ndiyo.

79
00:04:32,301 --> 00:04:37,435
Nobunaga alitumia bunduki nyingi katika mapigano.

80
00:04:37,458 --> 00:04:41,024
Kwa hivyo ndiyo sababu alishinda vita.

81
00:04:41,047 --> 00:04:42,781
Ndiyo.

82
00:04:42,804 --> 00:04:48,970
Alibadilisha mawazo ya kale na kujaribu kuunganisha Japani.

83
00:04:48,993 --> 00:04:53,227
Alikuwa mtu mwerevu sana, basi.

84
00:04:53,249 --> 00:04:54,939
Ndiyo.

85
00:04:54,962 --> 00:05:01,037
Lakini alikuwa mkali sana, hivyo alikuwa na maadui wengi.

86
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:03,660
Alikuwa mkali?

87
00:05:03,683 --> 00:05:05,416
Ndiyo.

88
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:09,172
Mwishowe alidhihakiwa na mmoja wa wafanyakazi wake.

89
00:05:09,195 --> 00:05:13,689
Eeh, historia hiyo ni ya kusikitisha.

90
00:05:13,712 --> 00:05:19,952
Lakini mawazo ya Nobunaga yalibadilisha Japani baadaye.

91
00:05:19,976 --> 00:05:23,342
Je, anaonekana mara kwa mara katika anime na maigizo?

92
00:05:23,365 --> 00:05:24,932
Ndiyo.

93
00:05:24,955 --> 00:05:30,355
Kama bosi mwenye ujasiri, anaonekana katika kazi nyingi.

94
00:05:30,378 --> 00:05:34,545
Kwa hivyo ndiyo sababu nilijua jina lake.

95
00:05:34,568 --> 00:05:36,101
Ndiyo.

96
00:05:36,124 --> 00:05:41,124
Picha ya Nobunaga huwa katika vitabu vya somo kwa hakika.

97
00:05:41,147 --> 00:05:46,914
Nitazame filamu kuhusu Nobunaga siku zijazo.

98
00:05:46,937 --> 00:05:49,770
Ndiyo, tafadhali angalia.

99
00:05:49,793 --> 00:05:53,365
Ni ya kufurahisha sana!

100
00:05:53,389 --> 00:06:00,494
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

101
00:06:00,494 --> 00:06:01,994
Mchezo wa 3: Shinsengumi na Okita Sōji

102
00:06:01,994 --> 00:06:07,727
Kyoto ina majengo ya kale mengi na ni nzuri sana.

103
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:09,717
Ndiyo, kweli.

104
00:06:09,740 --> 00:06:14,540
Hapa ni mahali pa Shinsengumi.

105
00:06:14,563 --> 00:06:17,896
Shinsengumi?

106
00:06:17,919 --> 00:06:20,686
Nimewahi kusikia.

107
00:06:20,709 --> 00:06:26,509
Ni kundi la wapiganaji wa zamani walilinda mji wa Kyoto.

108
00:06:26,532 --> 00:06:29,707
Walikuwepo watu wa aina gani?

109
00:06:29,731 --> 00:06:35,570
Palikuwepo mpiganaji mwenye nguvu zaidi aitwa Okita Sōji.

110
00:06:35,593 --> 00:06:38,289
Okita Sōji?

111
00:06:38,312 --> 00:06:41,246
Alikuwa mtu wa aina gani?

112
00:06:41,269 --> 00:06:47,235
Anasemekana alikuwa mtu mzuri, mchangamfu na mwenye tabasamu nzuri.

113
00:06:47,258 --> 00:06:52,828
Eeh, mwenye nguvu lakini mwenye tabasamu nzuri?

114
00:06:52,852 --> 00:06:54,485
Ndiyo.

115
00:06:54,508 --> 00:06:58,241
Nilipenda kucheza na watoto.

116
00:06:58,264 --> 00:07:01,558
Ulikuwa mtu mwenye upole, basi?

117
00:07:01,582 --> 00:07:06,949
Lakini alipokuwa na upanga, alikuwa mwenye nguvu kuliko wote.

118
00:07:06,972 --> 00:07:10,582
Tofauti hiyo inamfanya awe mzuri sana.

119
00:07:10,606 --> 00:07:15,982
Kasi ya upanga wa Okita ilikuwa ya haraka sana, inasemekana.

120
00:07:16,005 --> 00:07:20,072
Mpinzani wake hakuweza kushinda, basi?

121
00:07:20,094 --> 00:07:25,900
Ndiyo, alikuwa anaitwa mgeni mwenye vipawa zaidi katika Shinsengumi.

122
00:07:25,924 --> 00:07:30,003
Soji aliishi mpaka miaka mingapi?

123
00:07:30,027 --> 00:07:35,594
Kweli, alikufa akiwa na umri wa miaka ishirini baada ya kuugua.

124
00:07:35,617 --> 00:07:40,550
Eeh, alikufa akiwa na umri mdogo kiasi hicho?

125
00:07:40,573 --> 00:07:42,179
Ndiyo.

126
00:07:42,202 --> 00:07:45,736
Maisha yake yalikuwa mafupi sana.

127
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:51,093
Kwa sababu hiyo, anabaki katika mioyo ya watu zaidi.

128
00:07:51,116 --> 00:07:53,449
Hivyo ndivyo.

129
00:07:53,472 --> 00:07:57,839
Hata katika anime na michezo, ni mhusika maarufu sana.

130
00:07:57,862 --> 00:08:01,238
Anatokea katika anime zipi?

131
00:08:01,261 --> 00:08:07,261
Kuna nyingi kama *Fate* na *Hakuouki*.

132
00:08:07,284 --> 00:08:10,851
Aa, nafahamu kazi hizo.

133
00:08:10,874 --> 00:08:14,440
Wahusika wake ni wa kuvutia sana.

134
00:08:14,463 --> 00:08:19,297
Mfano wa wahusika hao ni Okita Soji huyu.

135
00:08:19,320 --> 00:08:23,772
Nimefurahi sana nikija hapa leo.

136
00:08:23,796 --> 00:08:28,840
Hekalu la Soji liko karibu, twende tukatazame.

137
00:08:28,863 --> 00:08:30,630
Ndiyo.

138
00:08:30,653 --> 00:08:33,420
Tafadhali, uniongoze.

139
00:08:33,443 --> 00:08:34,943
Sehemu ya 4: Utamaduni wa Chai na Rikyu

140
00:08:34,943 --> 00:08:38,961
Chai hii ya kijani ni tamu sana!

141
00:08:38,985 --> 00:08:41,161
Nafurahi kusikia hivyo.

142
00:08:41,184 --> 00:08:45,589
Chumba cha chai ni kimya na kinatoa utulivu.

143
00:08:45,613 --> 00:08:47,017
Ndiyo.

144
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:51,973
Nani alianzisha utamaduni wa chai nchini Japani?

145
00:08:51,996 --> 00:08:55,663
Mtu aitwaye Sen no Rikyū ndiye aliyeianzisha.

146
00:08:55,686 --> 00:08:58,375
Sen no Rikyū?

147
00:08:58,399 --> 00:09:00,765
Alikuwepo wakati gani?

148
00:09:00,788 --> 00:09:07,555
Alikuwepo wakati wa Oda Nobunaga na Toyotomi Hideyoshi, katika kipindi cha Sengoku.

149
00:09:07,578 --> 00:09:10,811
Alikuwa miongoni mwa wapiganaji, basi?

150
00:09:10,834 --> 00:09:12,607
Ndiyo.

151
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:16,964
Aliwafundisha wapiganaji juu ya chai.

152
00:09:16,987 --> 00:09:20,387
Wapiganaji pia walikunywa chai?

153
00:09:20,410 --> 00:09:22,068
Ndiyo.

154
00:09:22,091 --> 00:09:27,928
Walinywa kabla ya mapigano ili kutulia mioyo yao.

155
00:09:27,952 --> 00:09:29,624
Nimeelewa.

156
00:09:29,647 --> 00:09:33,585
Muda wa chai ulikuwa muhimu sana, basi?

157
00:09:33,608 --> 00:09:39,046
Rikyū alisisitiza umuhimu wa wabi-sabi.

158
00:09:39,070 --> 00:09:41,636
Wabi-sabi?

159
00:09:41,659 --> 00:09:43,873
Inamaanisha nini?

160
00:09:43,897 --> 00:09:50,497
Ni uzuri wa kimya, rahisi, na usio na upotevu.

161
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:55,053
Kwa hiyo chumba cha chai ni kidogo na rahisi kwa sababu hiyo?

162
00:09:55,076 --> 00:09:57,843
Hivyo ndivyo.

163
00:09:57,866 --> 00:10:03,351
Badala ya sahani za kupendeza, walitumia vyombo vya rahisi.

164
00:10:03,374 --> 00:10:07,607
Hata mlango wa kuingilia chumba ni mdogo sana!

165
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:10,637
Umeona vizuri!

166
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:15,860
Hata wapiganaji walipaswa kuacha silaha zao nje.

167
00:10:15,883 --> 00:10:18,083
Ahaa!

168
00:10:18,107 --> 00:10:21,740
Hivyo ndivyo, ndani ya chumba kilikuwa sawa kwa wote?

169
00:10:21,763 --> 00:10:23,297
Ndiyo.

170
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:29,053
Hata shogun na wapiganaji, walikuwa sawa ndani ya chumba.

171
00:10:29,076 --> 00:10:32,442
Hiyo ni wazo zuri sana!

172
00:10:32,466 --> 00:10:37,675
Kwa sababu ya Rikyū, utamaduni wa chai wa Kijapani ulikamilika.

173
00:10:37,699 --> 00:10:41,783
Rikyū alikuwa na tabia ya namna gani?

174
00:10:41,806 --> 00:10:47,406
Alikuwa mtu imara asiyekubali kubadilisha mtindo wake kamwe.

175
00:10:47,429 --> 00:10:52,198
Kwa hiyo ndiyo sababu aliweza kuunda utamaduni mpya, sivyo?

176
00:10:52,221 --> 00:10:53,824
Ndiyo.

177
00:10:53,848 --> 00:10:59,525
Hadi leo, ana athari kubwa katika usanifu wa Kijapani.

178
00:10:59,548 --> 00:11:04,446
Ni nzuri sana kusikiliza historia huku unakunywa chai.

179
00:11:04,470 --> 00:11:08,526
Ningependelea kukupikia kikombe kingine cha chai?

180
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,583
Ndiyo.

181
00:11:09,606 --> 00:11:11,373
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

182
00:11:11,396 --> 00:11:12,896
Sehemu ya 5: Hadithi ya Mafanikio ya Toyotomi Hideyoshi

183
00:11:12,896 --> 00:11:19,163
Eeh! Kasri ya Osaka ni kubwa na nzuri sana!

184
00:11:19,186 --> 00:11:21,477
Ni kweli kabisa.

185
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:26,583
Hii ni kasri aliyoijenga Toyotomi Hideyoshi.

186
00:11:26,606 --> 00:11:29,543
Toyotomi Hideyoshi?

187
00:11:29,567 --> 00:11:31,968
Alikuwa mtu wa aina gani?

188
00:11:31,992 --> 00:11:38,449
Hideyoshi ni mtu wa kipekee zaidi katika historia ya Japani.

189
00:11:38,472 --> 00:11:40,406
Kwa nini?

190
00:11:40,429 --> 00:11:45,674
Zamani alikuwa maskini sana, mkulima wa kawaida.

191
00:11:45,697 --> 00:11:49,378
Alichoanza kama mkulima?

192
00:11:49,401 --> 00:11:51,035
Ndiyo.

193
00:11:51,058 --> 00:11:54,191
Hakuwa na pesa wala nyumba.

194
00:11:54,214 --> 00:11:59,047
Je, alifanya nini ili awe mkuu wa Japani kutoka hapo?

195
00:11:59,070 --> 00:12:04,904
Alikuwa msaidizi wa Oda Nobunaga na alifanya kazi kwa bidii.

196
00:12:04,927 --> 00:12:07,860
Alifanya kazi gani hasa?

197
00:12:07,883 --> 00:12:13,180
Alikuwa akitambua viatu vya Nobunaga na kifua chake ili viwe vipesi.

198
00:12:13,204 --> 00:12:17,571
Alichemsha viatu?

199
00:12:17,594 --> 00:12:19,293
Ndiyo.

200
00:12:19,316 --> 00:12:23,883
Alikuwa mwerevu sana na mtu mwenye busara.

201
00:12:23,906 --> 00:12:27,239
Nobunaga alifurahi, sivyo?

202
00:12:27,262 --> 00:12:28,795
Ndiyo.

203
00:12:28,818 --> 00:12:33,952
Nobunaga alimpenda sana, na akaendelea kupanda cheo.

204
00:12:33,975 --> 00:12:39,008
Kisha hatimaye akawa mkuu wa Japani, sivyo?

205
00:12:39,031 --> 00:12:41,164
Ndiyo.

206
00:12:41,187 --> 00:12:46,830
Hakuna mwingine yeyote aliyeanza kama mkulima maskini na kuwa shogun.

207
00:12:46,854 --> 00:12:50,587
Ni hadithi ya ndoto kabisa!

208
00:12:50,610 --> 00:12:52,410
Ndiyo.

209
00:12:52,433 --> 00:12:57,600
Hideyoshi alipenda sana mambo ya kuvutia.

210
00:12:57,623 --> 00:13:00,922
Nimesikia alipenda rangi ya dhahabu.

211
00:13:00,945 --> 00:13:02,478
Ndiyo.

212
00:13:02,501 --> 00:13:08,268
Alijenga vyumba vya dhahabu na hata kasri ya dhahabu.

213
00:13:08,291 --> 00:13:14,347
Kasri hii ya Osaka pia ina mapambo ya dhahabu na ni nzuri sana.

214
00:13:14,370 --> 00:13:19,242
Alifanya sherehe nyingi ili kuwafurahisha watu.

215
00:13:19,266 --> 00:13:23,139
Alikuwa kiongozi mcheshi na mwenye nguvu, sivyo?

216
00:13:23,163 --> 00:13:24,966
Ndiyo.

217
00:13:24,990 --> 00:13:29,661
Kwa hiyo ndiyo sababu anapendwa sana na watu wa Osaka hata leo.

218
00:13:29,684 --> 00:13:34,976
Kusikiliza maisha ya Hideyoshi kunatia nguvu!

219
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:38,600
Tusiache kutafuta malengo yetu pia.

220
00:13:38,623 --> 00:13:40,190
Ndiyo.

221
00:13:40,213 --> 00:13:45,646
Twende ndani tuone maonyesho.

222
00:13:45,669 --> 00:13:47,169
Sehemu ya 6: Edo na Tokugawa Ieyasu

223
00:13:47,169 --> 00:13:51,702
Mji wa Tokyo ni wa shughuli sana!

224
00:13:51,725 --> 00:13:53,497
Ndiyo, kweli.

225
00:13:53,521 --> 00:13:58,609
Tokyo zamani ilijulikana kama Edo.

226
00:13:58,632 --> 00:14:02,472
Nani alianzisha Edo?

227
00:14:02,496 --> 00:14:06,963
Shogun aitwae Tokugawa Ieyasu.

228
00:14:06,986 --> 00:14:10,042
Tokugawa Ieyasu?

229
00:14:10,065 --> 00:14:13,556
Alikuwa na tabia ya namna gani?

230
00:14:13,579 --> 00:14:19,027
Alikuwa mtu mwenye uvumilivu sana na aliyejua kungoja kwa muda mrefu.

231
00:14:19,051 --> 00:14:22,920
Alikuwa mzuri wa kungoja?

232
00:14:22,943 --> 00:14:29,343
Kuna wimbo unaosema: 'Kama ndege haitaki kuimba, ngoja mpaka aimbe.'

233
00:14:29,366 --> 00:14:31,733
Inamaanisha nini?

234
00:14:31,756 --> 00:14:38,033
Hata kama ndege hawataki kuimba, inamaanisha kusubiri kwa utulivu hadi waimbe.

235
00:14:38,057 --> 00:14:40,066
Nimeelewa.

236
00:14:40,089 --> 00:14:43,107
Kwa hiyo, hawezi kulazimishwa, ndiyo?

237
00:14:43,131 --> 00:14:44,768
Ndiyo.

238
00:14:44,792 --> 00:14:50,792
Baada ya kifo cha Nobunaga na Hideyoshi, mwishowe alikuwa kiongozi mkuu.

239
00:14:50,815 --> 00:14:54,615
Ulikuwa na matatizo wakati ulikuwa kijana?

240
00:14:54,638 --> 00:14:56,238
Ndiyo.

241
00:14:56,261 --> 00:15:01,531
Wakati wa utoto nilikuwa mfungwa, na sikupata uhuru wangu.

242
00:15:01,554 --> 00:15:05,411
Kwa hiyo uliendelea kuvumilia kwa muda mrefu, ndiyo?

243
00:15:05,435 --> 00:15:07,047
Ndiyo.

244
00:15:07,070 --> 00:15:11,603
Kwa sababu hiyo, alijua umuhimu wa amani.

245
00:15:11,626 --> 00:15:16,839
Kipindi ambacho Ieyasu alikiumba kilidumu kwa muda gani?

246
00:15:16,863 --> 00:15:21,758
Amani iliendelea kwa miaka takribani miaka mia mbili na hamsini.

247
00:15:21,781 --> 00:15:24,468
Miaka mia mbili na hamsini?!

248
00:15:24,492 --> 00:15:27,786
Hiyo ni nguvu mno!

249
00:15:27,809 --> 00:15:32,661
Wakati huo, Japani haikuwa na vita kubwa.

250
00:15:32,685 --> 00:15:38,485
Kwa hiyo ndiyo maana utamaduni kama Rakugo na Kabuki zilianzia, zilikuwa za furaha.

251
00:15:38,508 --> 00:15:40,508
Ndiyo.

252
00:15:40,531 --> 00:15:45,098
Kwa sababu ya amani, watu wote walikuwa na furaha katika maisha yao.

253
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:48,534
Je, Ieyasu aliishi kwa muda mrefu?

254
00:15:48,558 --> 00:15:54,240
Kwa wakati wake, alikuwa mzee sana, akiishi hadi umri wa miaka sabini na tatu.

255
00:15:54,263 --> 00:15:57,797
Alikuwa akijali afya yake, ndiyo?

256
00:15:57,820 --> 00:15:59,420
Ndiyo.

257
00:15:59,443 --> 00:16:05,376
Alikuwa mtaalamu wa afya hadi alijitengenezea dawa mwenyewe!

258
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:10,332
Ili kufanikiwa, afya na uvumilivu ni muhimu, ndiyo?

259
00:16:10,355 --> 00:16:15,370
Kuna mengi ya kujifunza kutoka kwa mtindo wa maisha wa Ieyasu.

260
00:16:15,394 --> 00:16:20,528
Nikiwa ninatembea karibu na Ikulu, naona historia.

261
00:16:20,551 --> 00:16:25,799
Eeh, twende polepole na tufurahie matembezi.

262
00:16:25,822 --> 00:16:27,322
Sehemu ya 7: Uvutio wa Sakamoto Ryoma

263
00:16:27,322 --> 00:16:33,122
Picha ya mtu huyu, anaonekana mzuri sana!

264
00:16:33,146 --> 00:16:37,279
Huyu ni Sakamoto Ryoma.

265
00:16:37,302 --> 00:16:40,579
Yeye ni shujaa wa Mkoa wa Kochi.

266
00:16:40,602 --> 00:16:43,569
Sakamoto Ryoma?

267
00:16:43,592 --> 00:16:48,959
Ukikagua chini, anaivaa viatu.

268
00:16:48,982 --> 00:16:52,230
Umeona vizuri!

269
00:16:52,253 --> 00:16:57,886
Alikuwa miongoni mwa wapiganaji wa kwanza wa zamani kuvaa butsi.

270
00:16:57,909 --> 00:17:02,577
Si sandali, bali butsi za ngozi?

271
00:17:02,601 --> 00:17:04,234
Ndiyo.

272
00:17:04,257 --> 00:17:08,835
Alipenda sana utamaduni mpya wa kigeni.

273
00:17:08,859 --> 00:17:11,792
Alifanya nini hasa?

274
00:17:11,815 --> 00:17:18,548
Alikuwa mtu aliyeruka kote nchini ili kujenga Japani mpya.

275
00:17:18,571 --> 00:17:21,625
Alikuwa akipigana?

276
00:17:21,648 --> 00:17:23,820
Hapana.

277
00:17:23,844 --> 00:17:28,119
Alikuwa hodari sana katika kuleta umoja kwa njia ya mazungumzo.

278
00:17:28,142 --> 00:17:33,175
Aliwapatanisha makundi yaliyokuwa maadui?

279
00:17:33,198 --> 00:17:35,031
Ndiyo.

280
00:17:35,054 --> 00:17:40,888
Aliwapatanisha makundi makubwa ya Satsuma na Choshu.

281
00:17:40,911 --> 00:17:44,244
Hiyo ni jambo la ajabu!

282
00:17:44,267 --> 00:17:47,322
Aliwaeleza vipi?

283
00:17:47,345 --> 00:17:53,878
Aliwaambia, 'Tufanye kazi pamoja kwa ajili ya Japani nzima.'

284
00:17:53,901 --> 00:17:56,701
Alikuwa na mtazamo mpana, ndiyo?

285
00:17:56,724 --> 00:17:58,535
Ndiyo.

286
00:17:58,559 --> 00:18:03,226
Ryoma pia alianzisha kampuni ya meli.

287
00:18:03,249 --> 00:18:06,459
Je, ilikuwa kampuni ya kwanza nchini Japani?

288
00:18:06,482 --> 00:18:08,132
Ndiyo.

289
00:18:08,156 --> 00:18:12,823
Alitaka kufanya biashara na kuunganisha dunia.

290
00:18:12,846 --> 00:18:15,702
Alikuwa na ndoto kubwa!

291
00:18:15,725 --> 00:18:21,492
Kuna neno maarufu alilosema, 'Ninataka kufua nguo za Japani.'

292
00:18:21,515 --> 00:18:24,374
Kufua nguo za Japani?

293
00:18:24,398 --> 00:18:27,364
Ni njia ya kusema yenye kuvutia!

294
00:18:27,387 --> 00:18:33,554
Inamaanisha, 'Nataka kuifanya Japani iwe safi na mpya.'

295
00:18:33,577 --> 00:18:39,055
Je, Ryoma aliona Japani ya kipindi kipya?

296
00:18:39,078 --> 00:18:46,083
Kwa bahati mbaya, aliuawa akiwa na umri wa miaka 31.

297
00:18:46,106 --> 00:18:47,273
Ndiyo.

298
00:18:47,296 --> 00:18:50,829
Akafa akiwa mvulana hivyo?

299
00:18:50,852 --> 00:18:52,785
Ndiyo.

300
00:18:52,808 --> 00:18:59,241
Lakini, mawazo yake ndiyo yaliyoanzisha Japani mpya.

301
00:18:59,264 --> 00:19:04,864
Ningependa kwenda kuona sanamu kubwa ya shaba inayoinama juu ya bahari huko Kochi.

302
00:19:04,887 --> 00:19:06,703
Ndiyo.

303
00:19:06,727 --> 00:19:12,194
Sanamu ya Ryoma inayotazama bahari inasonga moyo kweli.

304
00:19:12,217 --> 00:19:17,310
Tutafanya mpango wa safari wakati wa likizo ijayo.

305
00:19:17,333 --> 00:19:19,066
Nzuri sana!

306
00:19:19,089 --> 00:19:22,423
Tutakula katsuuo tamu pia.

307
00:19:22,445 --> 00:19:23,945
Sehemu ya 8: Uvutio wa Ninja

308
00:19:23,945 --> 00:19:28,379
Wikendi hii nilitazama filamu ya mapigano ya ninja.

309
00:19:28,402 --> 00:19:30,688
Ilikuwa nzuri?

310
00:19:30,712 --> 00:19:32,278
Ndiyo.

311
00:19:32,302 --> 00:19:37,868
Ninja walipanda kuta, na hata kutoweka – ilikuwa ajabu!

312
00:19:37,891 --> 00:19:41,863
Ninja wa filamu wanafanana na wachawi.

313
00:19:41,887 --> 00:19:47,220
Ninja maarufu zaidi katika historia ya Japani ni nani?

314
00:19:47,243 --> 00:19:52,443
Mtu aitwaye Hattori Hanzō ndiye maarufu zaidi.

315
00:19:52,466 --> 00:19:55,320
Hattori Hanzō?

316
00:19:55,344 --> 00:19:58,411
Jina lake linatokana na michezo pia.

317
00:19:58,434 --> 00:20:00,168
Ndiyo, kweli.

318
00:20:00,191 --> 00:20:04,929
Hanzō alikuwa ninja aliyekuwa akilinda Tokugawa Ieyasu.

319
00:20:04,952 --> 00:20:09,719
Alikuwa amevaa nguo nyeusi na kuficha uso wake?

320
00:20:09,742 --> 00:20:14,601
Kwa kawaida alivaa nguo za kawaida za samurai.

321
00:20:14,624 --> 00:20:18,716
Hakuvaa nguo nyeusi?

322
00:20:18,740 --> 00:20:20,540
Ndiyo.

323
00:20:20,563 --> 00:20:25,396
Nguo nyeusi zingemfanya ajulikane zaidi.

324
00:20:25,419 --> 00:20:27,687
Kweli kabisa.

325
00:20:27,711 --> 00:20:31,444
Kazi halisi ya ninja ilikuwa nini?

326
00:20:31,467 --> 00:20:37,801
Kukusanya habari za adui na kulinda watu muhimu.

327
00:20:37,824 --> 00:20:41,190
Sio kupigana tu basi?

328
00:20:41,213 --> 00:20:46,624
Kazi yao kubwa ilikuwa kubeba habari kwa siri bila kupigana.

329
00:20:46,648 --> 00:20:51,143
Hattori Hanzō alifanya nini hasa?

330
00:20:51,166 --> 00:20:57,000
Alimsaidia Ieyasu kukimbia kwa usalama wakati wa hatari kwa kuvuka milima.

331
00:20:57,023 --> 00:21:00,756
Alimwokoa Ieyasu?

332
00:21:00,779 --> 00:21:02,412
Ndiyo.

333
00:21:02,435 --> 00:21:07,490
Ieyasu aliweza kuishi kwa sababu ya Hanzō.

334
00:21:07,513 --> 00:21:10,690
Hiyo ni mchango mkubwa!

335
00:21:10,714 --> 00:21:16,994
Hadi leo, kuna eneo litwalo Hanzōmon mjini Tokyo.

336
00:21:17,017 --> 00:21:21,665
Ndiyo, kuna kituo cha reli kinachoitwa hivyo.

337
00:21:21,689 --> 00:21:23,822
Ndiyo.

338
00:21:23,845 --> 00:21:28,679
Mahali hapo zamani palikuwa na nyumba ya Hanzō.

339
00:21:28,702 --> 00:21:33,749
Jina la ninja limekuwa jina la kituo cha reli?

340
00:21:33,772 --> 00:21:35,261
Ndiyo.

341
00:21:35,284 --> 00:21:39,484
Alikuwa akilinda geti la ngome ya Ieyasu.

342
00:21:39,507 --> 00:21:43,362
Ninja wanahisi karibu na sisi.

343
00:21:43,386 --> 00:21:47,998
Historia ya ninja halisi ni ya kuvutia.

344
00:21:48,022 --> 00:21:52,855
Nitaisoma vitabu zaidi kuhusu ninja.

345
00:21:52,878 --> 00:21:54,378
Sehemu ya 9: Yasuke: Msamurai Mweusi wa Japani

346
00:21:54,378 --> 00:22:00,811
Siku hizi niliona habari za kushtushwa kwenye mtandao.

347
00:22:00,834 --> 00:22:03,434
Habari gani?

348
00:22:03,457 --> 00:22:09,540
Zamani za Japani kulikuwa na samurai mweusi.

349
00:22:09,564 --> 00:22:13,701
Aa, unamaanisha Yasuke.

350
00:22:13,724 --> 00:22:17,291
Ndiyo, Yasuke.

351
00:22:17,314 --> 00:22:20,847
Alikuwepo kweli?

352
00:22:20,870 --> 00:22:23,642
Ndiyo, kweli.

353
00:22:23,666 --> 00:22:26,466
Alikuwa samurai wa Oda Nobunaga.

354
00:22:26,489 --> 00:22:32,056
Yasuke alitoka wapi kuja Japani?

355
00:22:32,079 --> 00:22:37,612
Nilitoka Afrika kwa meli pamoja na Mwitalia.

356
00:22:37,635 --> 00:22:42,609
Nobunaga aliona Yasuke, alifikiria nini?

357
00:22:42,632 --> 00:22:49,399
Kwanza, alifikiri ngozi nyeusi ilikuwa rangi ya wino iliyopakwa.

358
00:22:49,422 --> 00:22:52,655
Je, alimwagiza awe safi?

359
00:22:52,678 --> 00:22:59,612
Ndiyo, hata baada ya kuosha mwili wake, alikuwa mweusi, hivyo alishangaa sana.

360
00:22:59,635 --> 00:23:04,929
Hivyo, Nobunaga alimpendezwa na Yasuke, sivyo?

361
00:23:04,952 --> 00:23:12,634
Ndiyo, Yasuke alikuwa mrefu sana na nguvu kubwa.

362
00:23:12,657 --> 00:23:17,457
Ilisemekana alikuwa na nguvu sawa na watu kumi.

363
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:24,556
Ndiyo, Nobunaga alimpa jina Yasuke.

364
00:23:24,580 --> 00:23:27,858
Kisha, alimfanya samurai?

365
00:23:27,881 --> 00:23:34,718
Ndiyo, alimpa upanga na nyumba, na kumweka karibu naye.

366
00:23:34,742 --> 00:23:38,949
Je, Yasuke alikuwa anaweza kuzungumza Kijapani?

367
00:23:38,972 --> 00:23:44,788
Alianza kujifunza Kijapani kidogo kidogo na kuzungumza na Nobunaga.

368
00:23:44,812 --> 00:23:49,453
Je, alikwenda vitani pamoja na Nobunaga?

369
00:23:49,476 --> 00:23:56,209
Ndiyo, alipigana pamoja naye hadi mwisho ili kulinda Nobunaga.

370
00:23:56,232 --> 00:24:01,917
Mtu wa kigeni kuwa samurai, ni ajabu sana!

371
00:24:01,941 --> 00:24:08,015
Sasa hivi, anahusuwa katika anime na filamu za kigeni.

372
00:24:08,038 --> 00:24:11,646
Watu duniani kote wanamchungulia kwa makini, sivyo?

373
00:24:11,669 --> 00:24:18,403
Ndiyo, ni historia nzuri ya mtu aliyefanya vizuri bila kujali utaifa wake.

374
00:24:18,426 --> 00:24:22,159
Ninapenda kuangalia anime ya Yasuke.

375
00:24:22,182 --> 00:24:26,715
Tafadhali angalia, ni mzuri sana!

376
00:24:26,738 --> 00:24:28,238
Mstari wa 10: Uchawi wa Abe no Seimei / Abe no Seimei: Mchawi wa Hadithi za Simulizi

377
00:24:28,238 --> 00:24:34,972
Ninapenda kwenda Hekalu la Seimei huko Kyoto. Hekalu la Seimei?

378
00:24:34,995 --> 00:24:38,280
Hekalu la Abe no Seimei, ndiyo.

379
00:24:38,303 --> 00:24:43,270
Abe no Seimei alikuwa mtu wa namna gani?

380
00:24:43,293 --> 00:24:49,660
Alikuwa mtu wa kale nchini Japani ambaye alifanya kazi kama mchawi.

381
00:24:49,683 --> 00:24:52,483
Mchawi?

382
00:24:52,506 --> 00:24:54,672
Inaonekana kuwa ni ya kuvutia!

383
00:24:54,695 --> 00:24:58,065
Alikuwa anaitwa Onmyōji.

384
00:24:58,089 --> 00:25:01,376
Alifanya kazi gani hasa?

385
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:07,253
Alitazama nyota na anga ili kutabiri hali ya hewa ya siku zijazo.

386
00:25:07,276 --> 00:25:09,916
Alitabiri hali ya hewa?

387
00:25:09,939 --> 00:25:11,511
Ndiyo.

388
00:25:11,534 --> 00:25:16,801
Alitengeneza kalenda na kutabiri maombi pia.

389
00:25:16,824 --> 00:25:21,591
Je, ni kweli alifukuza pepo wabaya?

390
00:25:21,614 --> 00:25:29,080
Watu wa kale walikuwa wanamwamini Seimei kuwa aliondoa magonjwa na pepo.

391
00:25:29,103 --> 00:25:34,721
Nimesikia alikuwa na wasaidizi wasioonekana waliotambulika kama Shikigami.

392
00:25:34,745 --> 00:25:36,721
Ndiyo.

393
00:25:36,745 --> 00:25:41,945
Kuna hadithi kwamba alikuwa akiwashughulisha watu wa karatasi ili kufanya kazi.

394
00:25:41,968 --> 00:25:46,101
Ni kama dunia ya filamu za fantasia!

395
00:25:46,124 --> 00:25:47,730
Ndiyo.

396
00:25:47,754 --> 00:25:53,687
Kwa hiyo, mara nyingi huwa mhusika mkuu katika riwaya, filamu na manga.

397
00:25:53,710 --> 00:25:59,684
Mchezaji wa densi ya barafu Hanyu pia alitumia muziki wa Seimei, sivyo?

398
00:25:59,707 --> 00:26:01,474
Ndiyo.

399
00:26:01,497 --> 00:26:05,764
Ndiyo, alishinda medali ya dhahabu kwa programu hiyo.

400
00:26:05,787 --> 00:26:10,157
Vazi lake na densi zilikuwa za ajabu sana.

401
00:26:10,180 --> 00:26:15,788
Mpangilio wa mikono na alama ya pembetano pia ni alama za Seimei.

402
00:26:15,811 --> 00:26:18,778
Alama ya nyota yenye pembetano, ndiyo.

403
00:26:18,801 --> 00:26:20,434
Ndiyo.

404
00:26:20,457 --> 00:26:25,304
Hekaluni pia kuna alama nyingi za nyota hiyo.

405
00:26:25,328 --> 00:26:28,225
Je, ina maana ya kuzuia maovu?

406
00:26:28,249 --> 00:26:30,315
Ndiyo.

407
00:26:30,338 --> 00:26:33,872
Ni alama ya kufukuza vitu vibaya.

408
00:26:33,895 --> 00:26:37,579
Seimei aliishi mpaka umri gani?

409
00:26:37,602 --> 00:26:42,808
Aliishi zaidi ya miaka themanini na kuwasaidia watu wengi.

410
00:26:42,831 --> 00:26:48,565
Kwa wakati ule, miaka themanini ilikuwa ni umri mkubwa sana!

411
00:26:48,589 --> 00:26:50,047
Ndiyo.

412
00:26:50,071 --> 00:26:55,042
Labda alikuwa mtaalamu aliye na nguvu za ajabu.

413
00:26:55,065 --> 00:26:59,509
Nitakupata hirizi katika hekalu ili kuinua bahati yangu.

414
00:26:59,533 --> 00:27:02,902
Twende pamoja tukasali.